mygo-wallpaper (0.1.0-1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package.
  * Support Bing, private wallpaper API, MTphotos API.
  * GUI based on mygo(govcl), support Windows/Linux/XinChuang.
  * Support DDE/GXDE wallpaper setting.

